WEBVTT

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:19.740
Hop, step, jump.

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:21.640
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:23.450
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:24.900
Who I wanna be. 

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:36.150
They call me calm, strong, and cool. 

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:40.500
Everyone says I'm popular.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:43.910
But the truth is, I'm not like that at all. 

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:47.120
I'm just an ordinary girl! 

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:51.230
I wish I could just get rid 

00:00:51.230 --> 00:00:55.010
of all this pressure and be myself. 

00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:58.850
But they'd all say it's out of character. 

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:03.260
Unlock my heart! 

00:01:04.070 --> 00:01:08.610
Just be who you wanna be. 

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:11.460
Your Guardian Characters are with you. 

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:15.710
Just do it the way you wanna do it. 

00:01:15.710 --> 00:01:18.780
It'll be okay, really! 

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:23.690
Just be who you wanna be. 

00:01:23.690 --> 00:01:26.460
Having only one style would be way too boring. 

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:30.720
Just do it the way you wanna do it. 

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:34.990
You can do anything! 

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:36.610
I know that...

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:38.450
Hop, step, jump.

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:40.340
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:42.210
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:43.520
...is who I wanna be. 

00:01:44.720 --> 00:01:49.860
The new Guardian member, in other words, the fifth Guardian, is...

00:01:49.860 --> 00:01:52.020
The Joker: Hinamori Amu!

00:01:52.020 --> 00:01:53.080
Huh?

00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:55.890
What the heck is that?!

00:01:57.360 --> 00:01:58.850
What do you mean what?

00:01:59.270 --> 00:02:01.930
Oh, we're having brownies today.

00:02:01.930 --> 00:02:04.930
I love the brownies that Nadeshiko makes!

00:02:04.930 --> 00:02:06.390
Not that!

00:02:06.390 --> 00:02:10.740
You guys just brought me into the Guardians without permission, and what's a Joker?

00:02:10.740 --> 00:02:13.440
What? You don't know?

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:15.140
It's a trump card.

00:02:15.140 --> 00:02:16.340
A trump card?

00:02:16.340 --> 00:02:17.310
That's right!

00:02:17.590 --> 00:02:21.850
You have three Guardian Characters. That's amazing, and that's why you're the Joker.

00:02:21.850 --> 00:02:22.810
That's all there is to it.

00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:24.580
That doesn't help!

00:02:25.960 --> 00:02:28.180
The Joker has a special role to play.

00:02:29.030 --> 00:02:30.500
Special?

00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:35.900
We Guardians always seem like we're partying it up, but really most of our work is pretty boring.

00:02:35.900 --> 00:02:39.060
So basically, all the Joker has to do are the special missions.

00:02:39.060 --> 00:02:40.680
Being a Joker sounds so nice.

00:02:40.680 --> 00:02:42.190
You're right.

00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:44.230
Anyway...

00:02:45.080 --> 00:02:47.940
Here's your cape, Amu!

00:02:47.940 --> 00:02:48.950
Anything but that!

00:02:50.300 --> 00:02:55.600
It's okay, Hinamori-san, you only have to wear it for official functions.

00:02:55.870 --> 00:02:57.970
Let's work hard together.

00:02:57.970 --> 00:02:59.420
Tadase-kun.

00:02:59.420 --> 00:03:00.290
Amu-chan.

00:03:00.290 --> 00:03:01.730
She's getting carried away again.

00:03:01.730 --> 00:03:03.290
She is.

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:08.950
I'm the Trump Card!?

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:08.950
Episode 4

00:03:09.490 --> 00:03:12.470
It sparkles and shines!

00:03:12.470 --> 00:03:16.270
Twinkle!

00:03:16.270 --> 00:03:17.900
Ami-chan, bravo!

00:03:17.900 --> 00:03:19.410
Ami-chan, look this way!

00:03:19.410 --> 00:03:21.770
You're bugging the neighbors.

00:03:21.770 --> 00:03:26.140
So Ami-chan, are you going to take a bath with Mommy or Daddy?

00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:28.850
Daddy today!

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:30.020
I'm touched!

00:03:30.380 --> 00:03:35.160
Someday, <i>you'll</i> stop taking a bath with me, too!

00:03:35.160 --> 00:03:35.970
Sigh.

00:03:42.430 --> 00:03:45.600
You just have to drink milk after a bath!

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:47.420
Amu-chan, you're acting like an old man.

00:03:47.420 --> 00:03:48.750
Even though she's the heroine.

00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:50.350
Even though she's a Guardian.

00:03:51.550 --> 00:03:53.970
A Guardian...

00:03:57.410 --> 00:04:03.600
"Someday, someone special with three Guardian Eggs will appear. Keep this until that time comes."

00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:08.770
The Founding King left this Humpty Lock with those words.

00:04:09.300 --> 00:04:11.010
The Humpty Lock.

00:04:11.450 --> 00:04:16.050
Which means, there's a key to it, isn't there?

00:04:17.800 --> 00:04:20.600
We don't know.

00:04:20.600 --> 00:04:25.650
All we've been doing is handing down what the Founding King left us. In other words, this lock.

00:04:27.260 --> 00:04:30.620
But there is something of which we are certain.

00:04:32.190 --> 00:04:35.510
And that's, Hinamori-san, that this lock is yours.

00:04:35.510 --> 00:04:37.140
But there's one other thing.

00:04:37.140 --> 00:04:39.590
Here's a Guardian Egg pouch as a present!

00:04:39.590 --> 00:04:41.200
As you can see, it's designed like this.

00:04:41.630 --> 00:04:43.680
Your three Guardian Eggs fit in snugly!

00:04:44.890 --> 00:04:47.210
Wh-When did you guys...

00:04:47.210 --> 00:04:48.920
Yay, you got a present!

00:04:48.920 --> 00:04:51.050
Well, it'll be more like our home.

00:04:51.050 --> 00:04:53.750
I'll be able to sleep well!

00:05:06.540 --> 00:05:09.030
I guess being the Joker won't be so bad.

00:05:10.470 --> 00:05:12.270
What are you smiling about?

00:05:13.180 --> 00:05:14.740
She spit out the milk!

00:05:18.520 --> 00:05:21.470
You know, your breasts won't get any bigger just 'cause you drink that stuff.

00:05:21.470 --> 00:05:24.770
That's none of your busine- Wait, why are you even here?

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:28.030
You already know that my eggs aren't the Embryo!

00:05:28.030 --> 00:05:31.430
Oh, the Humpty Lock. You're going to try to steal it again!

00:05:31.800 --> 00:05:33.320
Nope.

00:05:33.820 --> 00:05:37.660
We're giving this to you as repayment.

00:05:37.660 --> 00:05:38.810
Repayment?

00:05:39.530 --> 00:05:41.310
There're a lot of snacks!

00:05:41.310 --> 00:05:43.430
It's like the stuff you'd have at your grandmother's house.

00:05:43.780 --> 00:05:45.810
What is this for?

00:05:45.810 --> 00:05:49.720
You made a dessert like that before, right?

00:05:49.720 --> 00:05:50.500
Huh?

00:05:51.430 --> 00:05:54.390
You mean the tart?

00:05:54.940 --> 00:05:57.180
So that was called a tart?

00:05:57.860 --> 00:06:01.100
Well, it's not like there's much of a difference between desserts, anyway.

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:03.720
That isn't true, but whatever.

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:07.070
But I guess he's trying to apologize.

00:06:07.070 --> 00:06:12.100
In that case, I should probably thank him. But wait, he was the one who destroyed the tart in the first place.

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:13.540
Well, anyway...

00:06:14.020 --> 00:06:14.890
Wait!

00:06:18.790 --> 00:06:24.220
Um, um... What are you after, Ikuto?

00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:26.350
Do you want to know?

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:29.310
Uh, yes.

00:06:31.070 --> 00:06:34.430
Fine, but you're the only one I'll tell.

00:06:34.820 --> 00:06:36.170
Lend me your ear.

00:06:36.170 --> 00:06:37.540
My ear?

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:39.310
It's okay.

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:41.480
Are you sure?

00:06:41.480 --> 00:06:43.390
Yeah, it'll be a secret.

00:06:43.390 --> 00:06:44.900
O-Okay.

00:06:48.560 --> 00:06:50.270
I tricked you.

00:06:48.560 --> 00:06:51.640
My ear!

00:06:51.900 --> 00:06:56.390
You pervert! Idiot! Liar! Perverted cat!

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:56.390
Amu-chan, don't get all worked up.

00:06:56.390 --> 00:06:58.390
What's wrong, Amu-chan?

00:06:58.390 --> 00:07:01.010
N-Nothing! It's nothing at all!

00:07:01.010 --> 00:07:02.810
Hurry home. Shoo, shoo.

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:05.660
There is one thing I'd like to tell you.

00:07:05.660 --> 00:07:07.430
Don't get involved with the Embryo.

00:07:08.580 --> 00:07:14.060
If you continue to stay with that little king of yours, we'll be enemies.

00:07:15.040 --> 00:07:16.020
Later.

00:07:19.220 --> 00:07:21.580
Enemies? What's that about?

00:07:26.850 --> 00:07:28.520
Nice weather.

00:07:28.520 --> 00:07:31.650
Indeed, perfect for training subjects.

00:07:31.650 --> 00:07:33.470
Oh, they're here.

00:07:33.470 --> 00:07:35.370
I'm going to pick up the pace!

00:07:36.110 --> 00:07:38.090
Amu-chan, keep fighting!

00:07:38.090 --> 00:07:41.240
W-Wait! Why are we racing around all of a sudden?

00:07:41.540 --> 00:07:45.640
If this is enough to make you give up, then you won't be able to complete the Joker's special missions.

00:07:45.640 --> 00:07:50.330
You keep saying special, but just what are these special missions, anyway?

00:07:55.290 --> 00:07:58.160
So what are the special missions?

00:07:58.160 --> 00:08:01.720
X Egg hunting. That's the Joker's special mission.

00:08:02.850 --> 00:08:04.350
X Egg hunting?

00:08:04.620 --> 00:08:07.830
You mean catching those weird-looking eggs?

00:08:08.390 --> 00:08:14.410
Yeah, if eggs go out of control and you ignore them, bad things'll happen to the egg's owner.

00:08:15.350 --> 00:08:22.770
That's why the Joker's job is to cleanse the X Eggs, or, in the worst case, to destroy them.

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:24.560
I don't really like that.

00:08:26.550 --> 00:08:31.720
I wonder if there really can be a good or bad egg in one's heart.

00:08:34.970 --> 00:08:36.470
Really?

00:08:36.470 --> 00:08:37.770
Yeah, yeah.

00:08:38.750 --> 00:08:41.630
Hinamori-san is with Kukai-senpai.

00:08:41.630 --> 00:08:46.040
She really is amazing, after all. It's like she has a completely different mindset than we do.

00:08:46.040 --> 00:08:47.190
Yeah.

00:08:47.990 --> 00:08:51.800
She was able to become friends with all the Guardians just like that.

00:09:00.010 --> 00:09:01.400
Really now.

00:09:02.710 --> 00:09:03.990
Yuki-chan.

00:09:04.970 --> 00:09:06.250
Yuki-chan!

00:09:07.260 --> 00:09:08.970
You were spacing out again.

00:09:09.490 --> 00:09:11.350
Are you even packing?

00:09:11.350 --> 00:09:12.500
I am.

00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:15.220
Okay, well, I just got a phone call from Dad.

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:20.010
He said he stopped by the elementary school you'll be transferring to in America.

00:09:20.690 --> 00:09:22.430
I see.

00:09:22.880 --> 00:09:26.390
You'll have to at least make sure you can say a greeting in English.

00:09:26.390 --> 00:09:29.640
You're a smart girl, so I'm sure you'll be okay.

00:09:29.640 --> 00:09:32.060
You'll be up to any challenge.

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:03.180
Vice Principal, good morning!

00:10:03.180 --> 00:10:04.960
Yes, good morning.

00:10:04.960 --> 00:10:07.690
Wonderful, all the kids are lively and full of energy.

00:10:07.690 --> 00:10:12.200
I thought I'd have to know all about my students, so I got these documents-

00:10:15.410 --> 00:10:17.060
S-Sensei.

00:10:17.060 --> 00:10:18.440
Ouch.

00:10:18.440 --> 00:10:20.560
I messed up.

00:10:20.560 --> 00:10:22.920
A-Are you okay?

00:10:22.920 --> 00:10:26.100
Yes, I'm used to falling down.

00:10:38.410 --> 00:10:39.390
Guardian News (Extra)

00:10:38.410 --> 00:10:39.390
In Love with the Joker!?

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:41.450
That's what we'd expect of you, Hinamori-san!

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:46.800
You weren't just quick to get the Joker's spot, you were quick to get Kukai-sama's heart, too!

00:10:46.800 --> 00:10:48.770
You're so cool!

00:10:50.430 --> 00:10:51.720
How stupid.

00:10:53.170 --> 00:10:55.680
She's "cool & spicy!"

00:10:55.680 --> 00:10:57.250
She's so cool.

00:10:56.620 --> 00:10:57.760
That's the Joker for you!

00:10:57.760 --> 00:10:58.700
So cool!

00:10:59.390 --> 00:11:02.600
I keep changing my personality in front of others.

00:11:03.070 --> 00:11:04.600
What? No way.

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:06.180
Is that really true, Yuki-chan?

00:11:06.180 --> 00:11:08.810
You're going to transfer all of sudden, and you're going overseas?

00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:10.300
Yeah.

00:11:10.300 --> 00:11:11.420
Really?

00:11:11.420 --> 00:11:13.150
Where are you going?

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:14.350
America.

00:11:14.350 --> 00:11:17.640
She's Hatoba Yuki-san, I think.

00:11:17.640 --> 00:11:21.430
Cheer up! Even if you leave, we'll still be friends!

00:11:21.430 --> 00:11:23.890
Yeah! That'll never change.

00:11:25.390 --> 00:11:26.430
Okay.

00:11:40.060 --> 00:11:43.490
Give us your new info. We'll call you.

00:11:43.490 --> 00:11:44.520
Yeah, right.

00:11:45.520 --> 00:11:47.390
Character Change.

00:11:48.870 --> 00:11:50.330
What was that voice just now?

00:11:50.330 --> 00:11:51.950
You heard it, too, Amu-chan?

00:11:51.950 --> 00:11:53.470
Y-Yeah.

00:11:54.430 --> 00:11:57.060
You liar! You'll change!

00:11:57.060 --> 00:11:59.390
You'll change and forget me!

00:11:59.390 --> 00:12:01.770
Yuki-chan, we'd never-

00:12:01.770 --> 00:12:03.640
That's mean! What are you saying?

00:12:05.490 --> 00:12:06.970
Yuki-chan!

00:12:07.770 --> 00:12:11.000
An X Egg! Then, that voice just now was...

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:11.810
Amu-chan!

00:12:11.810 --> 00:12:13.020
Yeah.

00:12:16.900 --> 00:12:18.400
Ouch.

00:12:18.840 --> 00:12:20.100
Sorry!

00:12:20.100 --> 00:12:22.700
No, I should be apologizing.

00:12:24.910 --> 00:12:27.660
You're Himamori Amu-san, right?

00:12:27.660 --> 00:12:28.560
What?

00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:31.140
Oh, are you not Himamori-san?

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:34.250
I'm pretty sure the attendance sheets were around here somewhere.

00:12:34.250 --> 00:12:34.600
Huh?

00:12:34.910 --> 00:12:36.040
Amu-chan?

00:12:35.090 --> 00:12:37.180
Huh?

00:12:36.040 --> 00:12:39.720
Oh, yeah. Anyway, I'm sorry about that!

00:12:41.060 --> 00:12:45.640
You shouldn't run in the halls, Himamori Amu-san!

00:12:53.720 --> 00:12:59.310
If we don't handle that X Egg quickly, we'll get yelled at.

00:13:04.410 --> 00:13:07.380
It didn't go that way-nya.

00:13:18.490 --> 00:13:21.330
Do Not Enter

00:13:22.380 --> 00:13:24.270
The Special Resource Wing?

00:13:26.630 --> 00:13:28.550
I didn't know this place even existed.

00:13:32.030 --> 00:13:34.220
Ha-Hatoba-san?

00:13:39.060 --> 00:13:41.030
I can't! I'm really bad with places like this.

00:13:41.030 --> 00:13:43.270
But we have to look for Yuki-chan.

00:13:43.270 --> 00:13:46.650
If you ask me, these places are the most suspicious.

00:13:46.650 --> 00:13:48.760
That might be true, but...

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:50.400
Then let's do a Character Transformation!

00:13:50.400 --> 00:13:52.310
If we Character Transform, it'll be fine!

00:13:52.310 --> 00:13:54.040
Oh yeah.

00:13:54.040 --> 00:13:56.030
If I remember correctly...

00:13:56.030 --> 00:13:57.430
Transform!

00:14:03.390 --> 00:14:04.780
See! I can't do it!

00:14:04.780 --> 00:14:06.970
Ran, what are you trying to make me do?

00:14:06.970 --> 00:14:09.570
It's not Ran's fault.

00:14:09.570 --> 00:14:11.930
It's because you have doubts in your heart.

00:14:13.220 --> 00:14:14.060
Me?

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:16.440
It's okay, Amu-chan!

00:14:16.440 --> 00:14:19.260
If you wish to be stronger, then you'll definitely be able to do it again!

00:14:19.260 --> 00:14:21.220
Amu-chan is up to any challenge, after all.

00:14:23.120 --> 00:14:24.390
It's impossible.

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:26.140
Amu-chan?

00:14:26.660 --> 00:14:31.060
Maybe I might seem like I'm up to any challenge...

00:14:31.060 --> 00:14:35.640
I've become a Character Bearer and a Guardian, and now there's Character Transformations...

00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:42.270
But that's all my outer character taking over. I just wonder where the real me is in all of that.

00:14:45.000 --> 00:14:46.800
I'm scared of changing.

00:14:46.800 --> 00:14:50.760
I don't want to change any more.

00:14:58.510 --> 00:15:00.490
Are you okay, Amu-chan?

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:08.390
Run faster, everyone!

00:15:09.140 --> 00:15:10.930
What's going on, anyway?

00:15:10.930 --> 00:15:13.060
I felt something bad!

00:15:13.060 --> 00:15:16.080
And what was that?

00:15:16.960 --> 00:15:18.220
We have to hurry!

00:15:18.220 --> 00:15:19.180
Yeah!

00:15:19.760 --> 00:15:21.580
W-What?

00:15:22.760 --> 00:15:26.190
Do you like English?

00:15:26.590 --> 00:15:31.310
No, I hate English!

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:38.020
What is that?

00:15:38.020 --> 00:15:41.020
Do you like English?

00:15:41.020 --> 00:15:42.800
That's so not cute.

00:15:42.800 --> 00:15:43.980
Could that be...

00:15:43.980 --> 00:15:46.350
There's no mistaking it, that's an X Character!

00:15:46.350 --> 00:15:49.180
Destroy!

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:52.100
What is this?

00:15:52.100 --> 00:15:54.480
Yahoo.

00:15:56.020 --> 00:15:59.330
Oh no! Fujisaki-san, you two look after Hatoba-san.

00:15:59.330 --> 00:16:00.240
Okay.

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:11.270
So this was a planetarium.

00:16:12.340 --> 00:16:14.510
It's almost like I've gone to a different world.

00:16:14.510 --> 00:16:17.220
The sky's slowly changing color!

00:16:17.220 --> 00:16:20.030
Oh, it's the first star!

00:16:20.030 --> 00:16:22.560
It's twinkling.

00:16:23.030 --> 00:16:30.560
How odd. It may change its color, and even look differently, but it's the same sky.

00:16:33.350 --> 00:16:36.350
Do you like English?

00:16:36.350 --> 00:16:39.970
Uh, I am a J-Joker?

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:42.310
Mistake!

00:16:45.320 --> 00:16:47.270
Was my English wrong?

00:16:47.270 --> 00:16:48.640
Wait, what <i>is</i> that?

00:16:51.170 --> 00:16:52.350
I'm scared.

00:16:53.960 --> 00:16:54.880
I don't want to go.

00:16:54.880 --> 00:16:55.800
I can't learn English.

00:16:55.800 --> 00:16:57.930
I don't want my friends to change!

00:16:57.930 --> 00:16:59.220
I don't want to change!

00:16:59.780 --> 00:17:01.770
Could these be Hatoba-san's...

00:17:01.770 --> 00:17:03.430
Hinamori-san!

00:17:03.430 --> 00:17:05.230
Tadase-kun. Kukai.

00:17:05.230 --> 00:17:09.570
Be careful. That's an X Character, born from an X Egg.

00:17:09.570 --> 00:17:10.640
An X Character?

00:17:10.640 --> 00:17:16.620
Yes, I am an <i>X Character! </i>

00:17:15.430 --> 00:17:16.620
Damn it.

00:17:16.620 --> 00:17:19.620
An X Character? Then, Hatoba-san is...

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:20.600
She's okay.

00:17:20.600 --> 00:17:25.600
But if we don't do anything about that X Character, she'll be in big trouble!

00:17:25.870 --> 00:17:27.890
Hinamori, Character Transform.

00:17:27.890 --> 00:17:29.390
Please, Hinamori-san.

00:17:29.850 --> 00:17:31.020
But...

00:17:31.020 --> 00:17:34.010
I hate! I hate!

00:17:34.010 --> 00:17:35.620
I'm scared.

00:17:34.460 --> 00:17:36.400
I don't want my friends to change!

00:17:35.620 --> 00:17:37.310
I don't want to change!

00:17:37.650 --> 00:17:39.790
Believe in yourself, Amu-chan!

00:17:39.790 --> 00:17:41.920
If you really believe in wanting to change,

00:17:41.920 --> 00:17:44.770
then the key in your heart will be released!

00:17:47.100 --> 00:17:49.310
You liar! You'll change!

00:17:49.310 --> 00:17:52.350
I just wonder where the real me is in all of that.

00:17:52.350 --> 00:17:53.680
I don't want to change!

00:17:53.680 --> 00:17:54.860
It's impossible.

00:17:54.860 --> 00:17:56.350
I don't want to change!

00:17:56.350 --> 00:17:58.060
I'm scared of changing.

00:17:58.060 --> 00:17:59.430
I don't want to change!

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:00.970
I don't want to change any more.

00:18:03.840 --> 00:18:06.220
Just hold on, Hatoba-san, I'll save you.

00:18:07.170 --> 00:18:09.720
My heart: Unlock!

00:18:47.850 --> 00:18:50.770
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:18:50.770 --> 00:18:52.470
Go, Hinamori!

00:18:55.170 --> 00:18:57.100
Hey, come on!

00:19:01.720 --> 00:19:03.600
Oh yes!

00:19:03.600 --> 00:19:06.260
Destroy!

00:19:07.850 --> 00:19:09.100
Amu-chan!

00:19:09.100 --> 00:19:10.770
Amu-chan, are you okay?

00:19:10.770 --> 00:19:11.720
Yeah.

00:19:13.180 --> 00:19:14.560
I don't want to change!

00:19:14.560 --> 00:19:15.970
I don't want to change!

00:19:17.600 --> 00:19:20.970
It's fine! It's fine to change!

00:19:20.970 --> 00:19:21.830
Uh oh.

00:19:22.380 --> 00:19:24.140
Negative Heart:

00:19:25.710 --> 00:19:26.890
Lock On!

00:19:32.350 --> 00:19:34.350
Open Heart!

00:19:37.850 --> 00:19:42.790
Oh no!

00:19:44.690 --> 00:19:46.770
The X was removed.

00:19:46.770 --> 00:19:48.820
Awesome, we got it!

00:19:48.820 --> 00:19:50.750
No, this is...

00:19:52.510 --> 00:19:55.750
Attention, please. Thank you, Amu-chan.

00:19:55.750 --> 00:19:57.780
Thanks to you, I'm at ease.

00:19:57.780 --> 00:20:01.020
You're who Hatoba-san really wants to be?

00:20:01.020 --> 00:20:04.580
Yes. But it'll still be a secret for now.

00:20:04.580 --> 00:20:10.300
I'll be sleeping for a bit longer, until Yuki-chan realizes it herself.

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:12.870
See you again.

00:20:31.970 --> 00:20:33.270
You're awake?

00:20:33.910 --> 00:20:35.910
What am I...

00:20:35.910 --> 00:20:37.850
You collapsed here.

00:20:38.760 --> 00:20:40.050
Are you dumb?

00:20:41.110 --> 00:20:43.710
No matter how far you go, you'll always be connected under the same sky.

00:20:43.710 --> 00:20:46.380
Your friends will always be your friends, no matter where you are.

00:20:46.380 --> 00:20:47.810
Isn't it okay to change?

00:20:50.490 --> 00:20:53.900
Well, something like that. I was afraid to change, too, you know.

00:20:53.900 --> 00:20:58.100
Let's get along together, from one scaredy-cat to another.

00:21:02.080 --> 00:21:03.010
Yeah.

00:21:05.580 --> 00:21:07.630
Oh crap! Class is going to start!

00:21:08.390 --> 00:21:10.380
Later! I'll be going ahead of you guys!

00:21:10.380 --> 00:21:12.110
Kukai, that's not fair!

00:21:12.110 --> 00:21:13.200
Don't leave me behind!

00:21:14.300 --> 00:21:16.230
Don't ask me.

00:21:18.140 --> 00:21:26.630
While your homeroom teacher is on maternity leave, I'll be taking over the Grade 5 Star Class-

00:21:19.870 --> 00:21:25.330
Nikaidou Yuu

00:21:26.630 --> 00:21:27.430
Sorry I'm late!

00:21:33.470 --> 00:21:35.270
This is the second time today.

00:21:35.270 --> 00:21:38.560
Oh, I met you before. You're a teacher?

00:21:38.560 --> 00:21:44.220
Yes, I'm Nikaidou Yuu. Now that I have a chance to greet you properly... Hello, Himamori Amu-san.

00:21:44.540 --> 00:21:45.850
Himamori?

00:21:45.850 --> 00:21:48.630
Anyway, first period's-

00:21:51.530 --> 00:21:53.690
He's quite the character. .

00:22:04.090 --> 00:22:09.710
So the girl who holds three Guardian Characters has finally appeared.

00:22:12.630 --> 00:22:15.380
It would seem that the story has just begun.

00:22:35.190 --> 00:22:41.290
As long as I exist, even when I'm a pile of dust, 

00:22:41.290 --> 00:22:47.690
I'll keep cheering "you can do it, you can do it" out loud! 

00:22:47.690 --> 00:22:48.510
(You can do it!)

00:22:48.510 --> 00:22:54.670
I'll never stop as long as I live,  

00:22:54.670 --> 00:23:01.020
so I'll sing my never-ending song. 

00:23:01.920 --> 00:23:05.530
I'll press forward down my path. 

00:23:05.530 --> 00:23:09.050
Even random characters have their merits. 

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:13.890
You might be worthless, but I'll still love you, 

00:23:13.890 --> 00:23:15.360
my darling.

00:23:15.350 --> 00:23:19.150
You idiot! My true self... 

00:23:19.150 --> 00:23:22.110
Just say what's on your mind. 

00:23:22.110 --> 00:23:25.540
You're sticking out a little. 

00:23:25.540 --> 00:23:28.810
You're coming closer to my dream. 

00:23:28.810 --> 00:23:32.590
You jerk! My true self... 

00:23:32.590 --> 00:23:36.840
Please come out, don't hide. 

00:23:36.840 --> 00:23:41.780
Oh yeah! Right now! 

00:23:50.540 --> 00:23:52.890
What is an X Character, anyway?

00:23:52.890 --> 00:23:55.840
X Eggs and X Characters... I so don't get them.

00:23:55.840 --> 00:23:58.560
It's just the way it goes. That's your duty as a Guardian.

00:23:58.560 --> 00:24:00.580
It's not like I wanted to be one.

00:24:00.580 --> 00:24:04.020
You were happy for the chance to get closer to your prince, though.

00:24:04.020 --> 00:24:05.090
Did you say something?

00:24:05.090 --> 00:24:07.350
Amu-chan, it's an X Character!

00:24:07.350 --> 00:24:09.300
I just don't know anymore! Let's Character Transform!

00:24:09.300 --> 00:24:10.040
Yeah!

00:24:10.040 --> 00:24:13.940
Next time on Shugo Chara: Shoot! Get that X Character!

00:24:13.940 --> 00:24:15.650
We're going to be awesome!

00:24:15.650 --> 00:24:19.400
When do I get to Character Transform?
